  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/iobcat1/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Review 2026-11-01 on 100b6fbb6e: no community companion of library_signatures/go.yaml exists (go.yaml:18-19 still defers gin.Default/fiber.New/echo.New to one; the ADR-0061 companion loader exists). Fixture with gin.Default().Run, fiber.New().Listen, echo.New().Start: all three method calls emit go:external:0-0:<name>, io-boundaries net_listen_edges 0. Note the rows belong in a signatures companion, not io_primitives_overlays/go-web-frameworks.yaml (which already holds the launch rows). MECHANISM: receiver bound to a third-party constructor return has no signature so the method falls to the external slot. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-fokup."  # 57e1
